  data: {
    LLM: "Choose trumps: pick your longest suit. From equal-length suits, prefer the one without very high cards (they may win tricks off-suit).\n\nTrack trumps and leads to avoid taking tricks when you need to survive. On a dog's life, save your card for a trick you can win.\n\nCount cards and manage knock-out risk each round; coordinate with hand size (fewer cards means fewer ways to dump losers).",
